ores at 4:08 of overtime in Flames' 4-3 victory over Flyers","description":"— Matt Coronato scored at 4:08 of overtime to give the Calgary Flames a 4-3 victory over the Philadelphia Flyers on Sunday night.","story":"CALGARY, Alberta -- — <a href=\"http://www.espn.com/nhl/player/_/id/4874730/matt-coronato\">Matt Coronato</a> scored at 4:08 of overtime to give the <a href=\"http://www.espn.com/nhl/team/_/name/cgy/calgary-flames\">Calgary Flames</a> a 4-3 victory over the <a href=\"http://www.espn.com/nhl/team/_/name/phi/philadelphia-flyers\">Philadelphia Flyers</a> on Sunday night.\n\n\r\n              Zane Parekh, <a href=\"http://www.espn.com/nhl/player/_/id/4312877/zach-whitecloud\">Zach Whitecloud</a> and <a href=\"http://www.espn.com/nhl/player/_/id/4352750/joel-farabee\">Joel Farabee</a>, while short-handed, also scored for the Flames (8-9-1). <a href=\"http://www.espn.com/nhl/player/_/id/4587843/yegor-sharangovich\">Yegor Sharangovich</a> had two assists.\n\n\r\n              Flames goalie <a href=\"http://www.espn.com/nhl/player/_/id/4319911/devin-cooley\">Devin Cooley</a>, in his first game back after missing five because of a lower-body injury, made 32 saves.\n\n\r\n              <a href=\"http://www.espn.com/nhl/player/_/id/5173105/denver-barkey\">Denver Barkey</a>, <a href=\"http://www.espn.com/nhl/player/_/id/3096237/noel-acciari\">Noel Acciari</a> and <a href=\"http://www.espn.com/nhl/player/_/id/4392072/owen-tippett\">Owen Tippett</a> scored for Philadelphia (4-10-5), and <a href=\"http://www.espn.com/nhl/player/_/id/2562601/sean-couturier\">Sean Couturier</a> added two assists. <a href=\"http://www.espn.com/nhl/player/_/id/3942459/dan-vladar\">Dan Vladar</a> stopped 22 shots.\n\n\r\n              Farabee tied it on a short-handed breakaway midway through the third period.\n\n\r\n              <hl2>Up next</hl2>\r\n              Flyers: At Vancouver on Monday night.\n\n\r\n              Flames: Host the <a href=\"http://www.espn.com/nhl/team/_/name/nyr/new-york-rangers\">New York Rangers</a> on Wednesday night.\n\n\r\n              ------\n\n\r\n              \r\n                <a href=\"https://apnews.com/hub/nhl\">See AP’s full NHL coverage here</a>","published":"2026-11-09T03:27:34Z"}}